WEBVTT

51:30.489 --> 51:32.699
(WIND BLOWING)

51:48.215 --> 51:50.509
I'm sorry to see you leave, Lannister.

51:52.386 --> 51:54.346
It's either me or this cold,

51:54.471 --> 51:56.723
and it doesn't appear
to be going anywhere.

51:56.848 --> 51:59.601
Will you stop at Winterfell
on your way south?

51:59.726 --> 52:00.936
I expect I will.
